The Rubiks Workspace authors have modified this code, starting on 2026-10-13.
The changes add Rubiks Workspace sign-in and company settings, Prime Agent
(Rubiks) installation and updates, the Prime Agent Data tab, updates from this
repository's GitHub releases, and Rubiks branding. The git history records each
change and its date.

These modifications are released under the same licenses as the code they
modify: GPL-3.0-or-later (LICENSE-GPL), with Apache-2.0 (LICENSE-APACHE) where
marked. Each crate's Cargo.toml states its license.

